&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학부 학위복, 학위모&nbsp;대여: 없음</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><font face=\"Thread-000029f0-Id-00000023\" style=\"text-indent: -52.26px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></font><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -52.26px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">○</span></span></strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></strong></span><strong><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">코로나19 확산 방지 및 예방을 위해</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">졸업생, 가족 및 지인은 가급적 학교 방문을 자제하여 주시기 바람</span></strong></strong></font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.5rem; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4. 기타</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.2; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가. 석·박사 학위기 수령 및 학위복, 학위모 대여는 별도 대학원 안내 참조</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.2; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">최근 2주 이내 입국자 및 발열, 호흡기질환(의심)자 교내 출입 불가</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.2; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 다.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">개별 방문을 하여도 학위복, 학위모 대여 불가능</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.2; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; -ms-word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 라. 졸업증서 수령 주소지 변경&nbsp;관련 사항은</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">소속 학과(전공) 학사행정실에 문의 바람.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">끝.</span></strong></strong></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
